WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.467 --> 00:00:10.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ THUNDER ]
♪♪♪

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:12.912 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt;OH HUSH, LITTLE ONE.
DON'T CRY, YOU'RE A PRINCESS!

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:15.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND NO ONE CAN EVER HURT YOU.
♪♪♪

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:18.952 align:start size:94% position:6%
NO.
&gt;&gt; PLEASED TO MAKE YOUR

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:21.654
ACQUAINTANCE, YOUR MAJESTY.
I'VE BROUGHT YOU A GIFT!

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:23.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; NO!
THE CURSE!!!

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:35.135 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HA HA HA HA HA!!
♪♪♪

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:39.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; PRINCESS VIOLA --
&gt;&gt; MY PRINCE!

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:43.109
I'VE MISSED YOU SO BUT YOU MUST
LEAVE -- IT'S ALMOST DARK.

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:46.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; BUT WHY DO YOUR ALWAYS MAKE
ME LEAVE?

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:48.415
&gt;&gt; DON'T ASK ME THESE QUESTIONS,
MY PRINCE.

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:57.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WELL LET ME ASK YOU THIS
ONE --

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:59.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
PRINCESS VIOLA, WILL YOU BE MY
BRIDE?

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:01.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH PRINCE BENEDICT, NOTHING
WOULD BRING ME MORE JOY.

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:06.433
BUT, I HAVE A TERRIBLE SECRET.
IF YOU KNEW IT, YOU'D NEVER WANT

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:14.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
TO SEE ME AGAIN.
&gt;&gt; NONSENSE!

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:21.147
&gt;&gt; YOU SEE, MY LOVE, SHORTLY
AFTER MY BIRTH, I WAS CURSED BY

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:24.951 align:start size:94% position:6%
AN SORCERESS.
&gt;&gt; NO CURSE COULD KEEP ME FROM

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:26.853 align:start size:94% position:6%
LOVING YOU.
&gt;&gt; YOU SEE, AS SOON AS NIGHT

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:28.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
FALLS I -- I BECOME SOMETHING
ELSE. I -- TRANSFORM.

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:31.224 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHAT DO YOU BECOME?
A BEAST?

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:36.863
AN OGRE?
WHATEVER IT IS, NOTHING CAN KEEP

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:39.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
ME FROM LOVING YOU.
&gt;&gt; YOU SWEAR?

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:41.034
&gt;&gt; I SWEAR ON ONE THOUSAND
LIFETIMES, THAT I WILL LOVE YOU

00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:47.340 align:start size:94% position:6%
TIL THE DAY I DIE.
&gt;&gt; WELL, OKAY.

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
I BECOME -- ME, BUT FIFTEEN
POUNDS HEAVIER.

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:53.980
&gt;&gt; OH.
&gt;&gt; BUT I AM SO RELIEVED TO HEAR

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:56.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOU DON'T CARE!
&gt;&gt; UH-HUH.

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:58.485
&gt;&gt; THAT I'LL BE YOURS AND YOU'LL
BE MINE FOREVER.

00:01:58.485 --> 00:02:01.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HMM.
&gt;&gt; IS THAT A PROBLEM?

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:03.723
&gt;&gt; OF COURSE NOT, MY DEAR.
THERE ARE MUCH MORE HORRID

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:07.260
CREATURES YOU COULD BECOME.
JUST -- FIFTEEN POUNDS WHERE?

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:10.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHAT?
&gt;&gt; IS IT LIKE, IS IT JUST IN

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:15.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOUR BUTT, OR BOOBS?
&gt;&gt; NO IT'S KIND OF ALL OVER.

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:19.239
&gt;&gt; GOT IT.
&gt;&gt; SOME PEOPLE SAY I LOOK BETTER

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:24.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
WITH THE 15 POUNDS.
&gt;&gt; OH, LIKE, YOUR FRIENDS?

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:29.182
OH DANG.
I JUST REALIZED, I HAVE A THING

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:32.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
UNTIL THE END OF TIME.
&gt;&gt; I KNEW IT, I'VE LOST YOU.

00:02:32.919 --> 00:02:39.759
[ THUNDER ]
&gt;&gt; THERE IS ONE WAY TO BREAK THE

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:43.396
SPELL.
BUT IN ORDER TO DO SO, YOU MUST

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:47.033 align:start size:94% position:6%
MAKE A SACRIFICE, DEAR PRINCE.
&gt;&gt; I WILL DO ANYTHING IF IT

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:48.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
FREES THE PRINCESS FROM THIS
TERRIBLE

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:51.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
CURSE.
&gt;&gt; AT NIGHT, YOU WILL LOSE ONE

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:53.339
QUARTER OF AN INCH OF FROM YOUR
PENIS.

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:54.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; NO.
&gt;&gt; OH YEAH, NO WE CAN'T AFFORD

00:02:54.707 --> 00:03:02.015 align:start size:94% position:6%
TO LOSE THAT.
&gt;&gt; HA HA HA!

00:03:02.015 --> 00:03:05.485 size:84% position:42%
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

